# ── Ganjineh repository: docs and screenshots only ─────────────────────────────
# This repo publishes documentation + PNG screenshots. The portable app is shipped
# as a GitHub Release asset (Ganjineh-1.1.0-win-x64.zip), never as a committed file:
# Ganjineh.exe alone is ~238 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
#
# The list below is deliberately broad: a careless `git add -A` in the parent folder
# must never sweep in 600 MB of binaries or one person's data folder.

# ── Personal data, never published ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# In portable mode Ganjineh keeps settings, accounts, cookies, the queue, the
# library index and logs in GanjinehData\ next to Ganjineh.exe.
GanjinehData/

# ── Release artifacts and app payload ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.7z
*.exe
*.asar
*.asar.before-*
*.pak
*.dll
resources/
locales/

# ── Maintainer working tree, staging and scratch output ────────────────────────
_work/
_work/release/dist/
_work/release/out/
_work/release/_tmp/

# ── Build and rollback backups ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Snapshots taken while patching the packaged app: app.asar.before-explore,
# app.asar.before-icon, app.asar.before-fix, Ganjineh.exe.before-version, …
*.before-*
*.new

# ── Local tooling, logs, debug state ───────────────────────────────────────────
DevToolsActivePort
lockfile
*.log
logs/
*.tmp

# ── Windows shell droppings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db

# Chromium profile locks and release manifests left behind by a run
SingletonLock
*.dat
*.bin
SHA256SUMS.txt
